    "description": "Ultrasonic water meter with dry dial, designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. Consists of a cast brass body with connecting screw threads, one pair of ultrasonic transducers and an electronic indicating device with LCD display (volume and flow display, volume resolution 0.00001 m³). Software separation; non-legally relevant communication via NFC sensor possible. Optionally equipped with an impulse module (not part of the certificate) and an internal NB-IoT communication module (not certified itself, no influence on metrological parameters). Powered by a non-replaceable 3.6 V battery. Displays separately delivered volumes for reverse and forward flow every two minutes. Shall be installed to operate in any position."
